// `category` and `readMinutes` are language-neutral (categories are translated in the UI).
// NOTE: scripts/sitemap.js finds articles with the regex /\{ id: (\d+), text:/ — keep each entry starting that way.
//
// Fields: text (title), textTwo (summary), headerText/aboutHeaderText (what is it), types[{t,d}],
// forKind/aboutKind, whyTitle/whyText, content, symptoms[], whenToSeeDoctor[], homeCare[], faqs[{q,a}].

